Use the attached image ONLY as a style reference (do not copy the person): flat cel-shaded digital illustration, bold graphic shapes, a deep navy-to-teal gradient background, a hood with a strong electric cobalt-blue rim light, and hard split lighting where one vertical band of the face is lit saturated red-orange and the rest falls into deep shadow.

Subject: the hero of a game called LOSE THE TAIL, a blocky voxel (Minecraft-like) character in a dark hoodie with the hood up, square head, two small glowing eyes. The red light band across half of its face comes from an off-screen public-ledger billboard (it is being watched). A few small voxel cubes dissolve off the back of the hood like a pixel trail. Mood: calm, defiant, about to disappear. No text, no logos. 16:9 landscape, character on the right third, generous empty dark space on the left for a title.
